<title>JAPAN: S&amp;P assigns A rating to Walt Disney samurai bond.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P assigns A rating to Walt Disney samurai bond.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's Corp (S&amp;P) said on Thursday that it had assigned an A rating to Walt Disney Co's 30 billion yen of 4.8 percent samurai bonds due on February 14, 2000.</p>
<p>S&amp;P said the outlook for the rating was stable.</p>
</text>
